/-! ###### the range-end anchor (am-cert, 2026-10-15)

Position code `34` reads the term range's end `U`; every other code is `gptF`'s (`33` the start `L`, else the grid
points).  `dec4GH` / `dec4RGH` are `dec4G` / `dec4RG` with `gptH` in place of `gptF`.  A decoded position enters the
leaf check only through the interval test, so the elimination lemmas are the same one-liners. ###### -/

noncomputable section

namespace AMW.Cert.PCell

open AMW.Cert AMW.Cert.Pyr AMW.Cert.PyrD


